window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-21534e9b200d17a6"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"build-a-variance-driver-bridge\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">建立差异驱动因素桥接分析</h1> <p>用来源依据解释实际数据、预算和预测之间的变化。</p> <p>提供实际数据、预算、预测、KPI、阈值和负责人笔记，让 ChatGPT 对重大变动的驱动因素排序，并生成可编辑的桥接分析，包含勾稽、待核实问题和来源引用。</p> <p><a id=\"best-for\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">适合哪些情况</h2> <ul> <li>预测与实际、预算与实际、或不同版本预测之间的审阅。</li> <li>涉及收入、利润率、运营费用、现金或资产负债表驱动因素的分析。</li> <li>希望在一个交付件中看到驱动因素排序、勾稽和负责人问题的团队。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"skills-plugins\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">技能与插件</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>技能或插件</th> <th>用途</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>$spreadsheets</code></td> <td>核对财务输入、计算重大变动，并创建带公式和检查项的可编辑驱动因素桥接表。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>$documents</code></td> <td>需要时，将有来源依据的驱动因素说明和负责人问题整理成便于审阅的备忘录。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><a id=\"starter-prompt\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">起步提示词</h2> <p>建立差异桥接表</p> <p>建议推理级别：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">请使用 $spreadsheets，解释 [period] 在 [actuals, budget, forecast, or prior forecast] 之间的变化。\n\n使用我附上的结账工作簿、预算文件、上一版预测、KPI 仪表板、运营费用跟踪表、现金视图和财务负责人笔记。请针对相关的收入、利润率、运营费用、EBITDA、自由现金流和资产负债表项目，建立可编辑的差异桥接表。\n\n按影响程度排列重大驱动因素，核对来源差异，起草负责人问题，并为每项驱动因素引用相应工作簿工作表、仪表板、跟踪表或笔记。低于 [threshold] 的变动请单独标出。如果来源只能支持一种假设，就不要给出确定的解释。\n</code></pre> <p><a id=\"related-links\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">关联文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-575ba4762ea69b23\">智能体技能</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>完整文档索引请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"introduction\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_6\">简介</h2> <p>差异桥接分析会把报告中的变化连接到背后的运营驱动因素。ChatGPT 可以核对实际数据、预算、预测、KPI 和负责人笔记，然后排列驱动因素，并区分有证据支持的解释与仍需负责人确认的问题。</p> <p><a id=\"choose-the-comparison\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_7\">选择比较口径</h2> <p>明确要比较的期间和版本，例如预测与实际、预算与实际，或当前预测与上一版预测。提供重要性阈值、正负号约定，以及本次审阅关注的财务项目。</p> <ol> <li>附上实际数据、预算、预测、KPI 数据和负责人笔记。</li> <li>定义比较对象、重要性阈值和所需财务项目。</li> <li>运行起始提示词，要求提供可编辑的桥接分析工作簿。</li> <li>检查来源差异、正负号约定和驱动因素排序。</li> <li>在同一聊天中继续解决负责人问题并准备说明文字。</li> </ol> <p><a id=\"challenge-the-explanations\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_8\">质疑解释是否有依据</h2> <p>驱动因素说明应以证据为准。如果源文件显示有变化、却不能证明变化原因，请让 ChatGPT 明确标注为假设。</p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Challenge the explanations in the variance bridge.\n\nFor each material driver, show:\n\n- the calculated impact and sign\n- the source file, tab, dashboard, tracker, or note\n- whether the explanation is supported, inferred, or still open\n- any reconciliation break\n- the owner question needed to close the gap\n\nRe-rank the bridge by absolute impact and keep unsupported explanations out of the executive summary.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">质疑差异桥分析中的各项解释。\n\n对每个重大驱动因素，展示：\n\n- 计算出的影响及其正负方向\n- 对应的源文件、工作表、仪表板、跟踪表或记录\n- 解释有证据支持、属于推断，还是仍待确认\n- 任何无法勾稽一致之处\n- 为弥补证据缺口而需要向负责人提出的问题\n\n按影响的绝对值重新排列差异桥分析，不要将缺乏支持的解释写进管理层摘要。</div></div>","en":"<h1 id=\"build-a-variance-driver-bridge\">Build a variance driver bridge</h1> <p>Explain movements across actuals, budget, and forecast with source-backed drivers.</p> <p>Give ChatGPT actuals, budget, forecasts, KPI data, thresholds, and owner notes, then ask it to rank the drivers behind material movements and produce an editable bridge with reconciliations, questions, and source citations.</p> <h2 id=\"best-for\">Best for</h2> <ul> <li>Forecast-to-actual, budget-to-actual, and forecast-to-forecast reviews.</li> <li>Analyses spanning revenue, margin, operating expense, cash, or balance-sheet drivers.</li> <li>Teams that need ranked drivers, reconciliations, and owner questions in one deliverable.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"skills-plugins\">Skills &amp; Plugins</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Skill or plugin</th> <th>Why use it</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>$spreadsheets</code></td> <td>Reconcile finance inputs, calculate material movements, and create an editable driver bridge with formulas and checks.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>$documents</code></td> <td>Package source-backed driver commentary and owner questions into a reviewable memo when needed.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <h2 id=\"starter-prompt\">Starter prompt</h2> <p>Build the variance bridge</p> <p>Suggested reasoning effort：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Use $spreadsheets to explain the [period] movement between [actuals, budget, forecast, or prior forecast].\n\nUse the attached close workbook, budget file, prior forecast, KPI dashboard, operating-expense tracker, cash view, and finance-owner notes. Build an editable variance bridge across the relevant revenue, margin, operating-expense, EBITDA, free-cash-flow, and balance-sheet lines.\n\nRank material drivers by impact, reconcile source breaks, draft owner questions, and cite the workbook tab, dashboard, tracker, or note behind each driver. Flag movements that are below [threshold] separately. Do not write a definitive explanation when the sources only support a hypothesis.\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"related-links\">Related links</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-575ba4762ea69b23\">Agent skills</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"introduction\">Introduction</h2> <p>A variance bridge connects a reported movement to the operational drivers behind it. ChatGPT can reconcile actuals, budget, forecasts, KPI data, and owner notes, then rank the drivers and separate supported explanations from questions that still need an owner.</p> <h2 id=\"choose-the-comparison\">Choose the comparison</h2> <p>Define the periods and versions you want to compare, such as forecast to actual, budget to actual, or current forecast to prior forecast. Provide the materiality threshold, sign conventions, and the finance lines that matter for this review.</p> <ol> <li>Attach the actuals, budget, forecasts, KPI data, and owner notes.</li> <li>Define the comparison, materiality threshold, and required finance lines.</li> <li>Run the starter prompt and ask for an editable bridge workbook.</li> <li>Review source breaks, sign conventions, and driver rankings.</li> <li>Continue in the same chat to resolve owner questions and prepare commentary.</li> </ol> <h2 id=\"challenge-the-explanations\">Challenge the explanations</h2> <p>Driver commentary should follow the evidence. Ask ChatGPT to label hypotheses clearly when the source files show a movement but do not establish its cause.</p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Challenge the explanations in the variance bridge.\n\nFor each material driver, show:\n\n- the calculated impact and sign\n- the source file, tab, dashboard, tracker, or note\n- whether the explanation is supported, inferred, or still open\n- any reconciliation break\n- the owner question needed to close the gap\n\nRe-rank the bridge by absolute impact and keep unsupported explanations out of the executive summary.\n</code></pre>"};
